OL,3,GNEWSACandles to remember loved ones at
OL,4,Achurch and quay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of candles will be lit in
OL,7,Fmemory of loved ones as part of events
OL,8,Fto raise money for a hospice charity.
OL,10,FThe lanterns, fitted with with LED
OL,11,Flights, carry personal messages to
OL,12,Freflect, remember and celebrate friends
OL,13,Fand family before they are placed
OL,14,Ftogether to form a large display.
OL,16,FThe remembrance evenings are being held
OL,17,Fby Lewis-Manning Hospice Care to raise
OL,18,Fmoney for its counselling service. The
OL,19,FPoole-based charity provides free care
OL,20,Fand support for people with a
OL,21,Flife-limiting illness, their carers and
OL,22,Floved ones.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
